6) Turbulence study additions (this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    Restoration networks (DATUM, TMT, MambaTM) are NOT distributed here: no code and no
    weights. `onarim_kos.py` and `turb/restoration.py` contain only wrapper code written
    for this study; the networks must be obtained from their authors under their terms.
    The real imagery of Saha et al. (2022) and the EuRoC MAV images are NOT redistributed;
    `results/` holds only numerical records and statistics derived in this study.
    Third-party odometry systems (ORB-SLAM3, AirSLAM, DROID-SLAM) are not included.
